    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be landesmannes tyhte.] [Ld] ⁊ gif man secge on landesmann þæt he orf stæle oððon man sloge, ⁊ hit secge on sceiðman ⁊ an landesman, ðonne ne beo he nane[s] andsæces wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a man of our country is charged with having stolen cattle or with having slain anyone, and the charge is brought by one Viking and one man belonging to this country, he shall not be entitled to make any denial.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si dicatur in compatriota, quod furtum fecerit uel hominem occiderit, et hoc dicat unus sceidmannus et unus landesmannus, tunc non sit aliqua negatione dignus.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
